## 智能体指南

### 开发流程

1. 获取任务：`python3 .harness/feature_cli.py next`
2. 开始开发：`python3 .harness/feature_cli.py begin FXXX`
3. 编码 + 测试
4. 完成提交：`complete` + `git commit`

### 遇到问题时

```bash
# 查看功能详情
python3 .harness/feature_cli.py context

# 查看项目记忆
cat .harness/memory/structure.md   # 代码结构
cat .harness/memory/interfaces.md  # 接口文档
cat .harness/memory/decisions.md   # 设计决策

# 检查代码规范
.harness/dev.sh lint
```

### 记录知识

```bash
# 记录设计决策
.harness/dev.sh remember "决策主题" "决策原因"

# 查看记忆状态
.harness/dev.sh memory status
```
